    "implementation_evidence": "Working-tree implementation of SDD-01 to SDD-06 exists (next-action.js, gate-check.js, delivery-map.js, gate-policy.js constant, run-recording.js refresh, service.js import) with tests; test:control-state fails at artefact-recording-test.js:258 under the equality rule. Retained code and tests require fresh assessment under the renewed TP.",
